WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
you're welcome

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,800
The medical base is for rescuing survivors.

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,560
Do you know the inside story about the loss you faced that day?

4
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,880
Originally, my family and I had a very peaceful day there.

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,840
Suddenly, all around are the low-income people who have lost their lives.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,960
Countless losses are like going crazy

7
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,040
They all gathered together

8
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,680
That monster took us out

9
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,360
Just admitted to killing my boyfriend and companion mother

10
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,360
Just kill me if you show up

11
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:22,240
You are simply a monster to be killed

12
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,960
If it's like what he described

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,120
This will definitely pose a huge danger to human survival

14
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:28,760
Then why did he say it was his personal grudge that day?

15
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:29,960
You've known each other before

16
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:34,830
Who will know

17
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:37,500
Okay, you should rest first. Something is wrong.

18
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,550
If it's really like what he said

19
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:41,110
He's a madman who takes pleasure in killing people.

20
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:43,190
We will take the initiative to let the loss retreat

21
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:44,950
He even negotiated with us and said he didn’t want to be disturbed.
